          </p>

          <p>
            Genuine's 4.94 lb tub holds about 32 servings of 32 g. Its list price is high, but it is frequently discounted, so the cost per 25 g swings from around $1.00 on a good deal to $1.80 or more at full price. The 100% Whey sits in the middle at roughly $1.20 to $1.60 per 25 g. Zero, with only 15 g per serving in a smaller 1.65 lb tub, typically costs the most per gram of protein in the range.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8 my-8">
