                Yes, as long as you pick the right tub. Pro Series and 100% Whey both deliver a full dose of protein with most of their calories coming from protein, which is what matters for muscle gain. Genuine works too but adds a lot of carbohydrate and fat. Total daily protein and consistent training matter far more than which Muscle Milk product you choose.
